    "created_at": "2021-10-06T10:45:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-06T10:45:54Z",
    "body": "Maybe the solution is simply to declare that a specific set of platform streams are \"fully detachable\" and standardise their behaviour explicitly? I was hoping to make optimisation transparent to developers, but it seems that might not be realistically achievable.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
