    "updated_at": "2021-10-09T21:34:49Z",
    "body": "FWIW, I have modified the mediacapture-streams proposal to allow MSTP/MSTG to run on any thread - because it makes sense to do so for some scenarios.\r\n\r\nGiven that transferable streams exist, and have worked well in practice, I see no reason to mandate where the streams are created.",
